Encoding (RoPE) and its advantages\n\nInspiration has been heavily taken from the following blog:\nhttps://huggingface.co/blog/designing...\n\nTo have a deep dive at transformers, consider reading my blog on the topic:\nhttps://goyalpramod.github.io/blogs/T...\n\nChapters: \n\n0:00 Introduction\n0:30 Why we need positional Encoding\n3:00 Integer Encoding\n4:00 Sinusoidal Encoding\n6:10 Rotary Position Encoding\n7:10 RoPE Explained\n8:45 RoPE Summary\n\nFeel free to reach out to me from my various socials, I am more than happy to talk to people about stuff (not limited to AI/ML).","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":630,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBgQ040EGAgiEwid49rw-POTAxXQpSsGHZWhFABIhdnr-93olLaIAcoBBGFlopQ=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqblhkVFdrblJoRTJ1YWI4U3BrbjZDUHlBeG5Od3xBQ3Jtc0tsRS1DdnJxOWFqSEFvWTRPSDZOXzNmQ3JvRFlidU9xbXVDa1phbHZvbU91bWtRWEx6eU5FdUEycGFVbFJpU3ZwNTRoQnU1b0NfS0Y3YnpwNWYwNF93MEtndm10NEFoSUJCaFRmc0FuS2N0U3VMQjMySQ\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fblog%2Fdesigning-positional-encoding\u0026v=iGxTRd967IU","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqblhkVFdrblJoRTJ1YWI4U3BrbjZDUHlBeG5Od3xBQ3Jtc0tsRS1DdnJxOWFqSEFvWTRPSDZOXzNmQ3JvRFlidU9xbXVDa1phbHZvbU91bWtRWEx6eU5FdUEycGFVbFJpU3ZwNTRoQnU1b0NfS0Y3YnpwNWYwNF93MEtndm10NEFoSUJCaFRmc0FuS2N0U3VMQjMySQ\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fblog%2Fdesigning-positional-encoding\u0026v=iGxTRd967IU","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":748,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBgQ040EGAgiEwid49rw-POTAxXQpSsGHZWhFABIhdnr-93olLaIAcoBBGFlopQ=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVZ6VjlISDJ2YU83WFN5VUVveWNzWjlWTEdRQXxBQ3Jtc0